# --- Cloned reference engines (external read-only checkouts) ---
engines/

# --- Agent scratch / IDE state ---
# `thinking/` is GONE: the cross-session notes it once held moved to `progress/`
# (dated one-shot docs) and to the `results.md` journals, and the directory was empty.
# Do not recreate it; a new top-level dir here needs a .gitignore decision of its own.
.junie/
# Pi harness state, written by the harness itself — never authored here. The one
# instance today is `engine/.pi/subagents.json`: the pi-subagents plugin's resolved
# run settings (every value in it is a plugin default), written when a worker runs
# with cwd=engine/. Two docs already require it to stay out of commits
# (progress/2026-10-14/HANDOFF-2026-10-14.md, progress/2026-10-14/speedup-routes-2026-10-14.md). Blanket `.pi/`
# at any depth; if this repo ever *authors* pi config (`.pi/settings.json`,
# `.pi/agents/*.md`), replace this line with an explicit allowlist — git cannot
# re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded.
.pi/

